cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "SPUR-yolo11n: SPUR (ICML 2026) reimplemented on YOLO11n-det"
message: "If you use this code, please cite the original SPUR paper and this reproduction."
type: software
authors:
  - name: "SPUR-yolo11n contributors"
version: 0.1.0
license: MIT
abstract: >
  A from-scratch PyTorch re-implementation of SPUR (Scale-aware Proxy Uncertainty
  Reweighting, ICML 2026) on top of a YOLO11n-det backbone. The original paper uses
  YOLOv4-tiny; this repository replaces the backbone and anchor head with the
  anchor-free YOLO11n while keeping all three SPUR stages (warmup / control /
  full) and their hyper-parameters identical.
references:
  - type: conference-paper
    title: "SPUR: (original ICML 2026 paper — replace with full citation on release)"
    authors:
      - name: "Original SPUR authors"
    year: 2026
